#. Tag: author
#: imageviewer.docbook:5
#, no-c-format
msgid "<firstname>Markus</firstname><surname>Leuthold</surname>"
msgstr "<firstname>Markus</firstname><surname>Leuthold</surname>"

#. Tag: email
#: imageviewer.docbook:7
#, no-c-format
msgid "kusi _AT forum dot titlis _dot org"
msgstr "kusi _AT forum dot titlis _dot org"

#. Tag: para
#: imageviewer.docbook:12
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The Kipi imageviewer is a very fast and flexible tool for viewing images, "
"based on OpenGL."
msgstr ""
"Kipi preglednik slika je veoma brz i fleksibilan alat za gledanje slika, "
"zasnovan na OpenGL."

#. Tag: keyword
#: imageviewer.docbook:18
#, no-c-format
msgid "<keyword>KDE</keyword>"
msgstr "<keyword>KDE</keyword>"

#. Tag: keyword
#: imageviewer.docbook:19
#, no-c-format
msgid "Kipi"
msgstr "Kipi"

#. Tag: title
#: imageviewer.docbook:23
#, no-c-format
msgid "OpenGL Imageviewer"
msgstr "OpenGL Slikovnik"

#. Tag: para
#: imageviewer.docbook:25
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The KIPI imageviewer allows to display a selection of images and to do basic "
"operations, such as rotation, zooming or panning. The usage of the viewer is "
"only based on keyboard shortcuts and mouse gestures. It was placed emphasis "
"mainly on speed in displaying as well as fast access to the functions."
msgstr ""
"Kipi slikovnik omogućuje prikazivanje odabrane slike i radi osnovne "
"operacije, kao sto je rotacija, zumiranje ili panning. Korišćenje slikovnika "
"je  samo bayiran na prečice  tastature i pokrete miša. Naglasak je stavljen "
"uglavnom na brzinu prikazivanja kao i brzi pristup funkcijama."

